            "answer": "The differences between `mm_kwargs` and `tok_kwargs` when using the `_call_hf_processor` method in vLLM multimodal processing are:\n\n- `mm_kwargs` is used to both initialize and call the Hugging Face processor.\n- `tok_kwargs` is only used to call the Hugging Face processor.\n\nThis allows for a flexible handling of both the model inputs and the tokenizer parameters during the processor call."
